  "text": "Polygon's x402 documentation describes HTTP 402 Payment Required as a request-and-response flow for on-chain API, web-service and agent payments. It lists separate Polygon Mainnet and Amoy testnet facilitators, alongside other provider routes, and links integration guides, a wallet MCP tool and mainnet-address analytics. Mainnet and testnet are not interchangeable. A documented endpoint or provider listing does not establish a completed payment, free access, escrow protection or guaranteed provider availability.",
